# data files never go to github
data/raw/
data/processed/
*.csv
!data/borough_population.csv
!data/forecasts/*.csv
*.parquet
# small API aggregates, refreshed monthly by .github/workflows/monthly-refresh.yml
!data/live/*.csv
!data/live/*.parquet
# reporting-gap inputs and results (small; fetched once, reproducible)
!data/equity/*.csv
!data/equity/results/*.csv

